# CLAUDE.local.md — site profile (copy to CLAUDE.local.md; it's gitignored)

Claude Code loads this next to CLAUDE.md. Everything specific to *your* site goes here,
never in tracked files. Replace every <...>.

## Network

| Device | Address | Notes |
|---|---|---|
| Raspberry Pi (broker, controller, dashboard) | <192.168.1.10> | give it a DHCP reservation |
| Smart plug | <192.168.1.20> | reservation; local API enabled |
| Tank A node | <USB on the Pi, or 192.168.1.40> | |
| Tank B node | <192.168.1.41> | |
| Solar dongle (optional) | <192.168.1.30:502> | Modbus TCP, one client only |
| E-ink display (optional) | <DHCP> | |

- WiFi SSID / password: <in firmware secrets.h only — don't repeat it here unless you want to>
- Pi SSH: user <pi>, key <~/.ssh/pumpastic>, deploy path </home/pi/pumpastic>
- Workstation serial port for flashing: <COM3 or /dev/ttyACM0>

